# The XFCE session both variants start from: the session manager, the window
# manager, and the pieces a partial session leaves for later (panel, desktop).
# Retrobox can run on the session alone and bring the panel and the desktop up
# when it exits.

xfce4-session
xfwm4
xfce4-panel
xfdesktop4
xfce4-settings
xfce4-terminal
lxpolkit
gvfs
adwaita-icon-theme
